+/*
+ * barre (https://github.com/bluesky-social/barre) for React Native: the C
+ * interface between Yoga's C++ nodes and barre-rn, the Rust staticlib that
+ * replaces yoga::calculateLayout when enabled. barre-rn mirrors these
