+ * for barre's per-node state: a header (below), snapshots of the node's style
+ * and config, and barre's layout results and caches. It is plain data, so
+ * copying a node (RN clones shadow nodes by copy-constructing yoga::Node)
+ * copies barre's caches exactly as it copies Yoga's.
